From 45ad0e358a5549e86fbcf326562d3539e2bfd831 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: RCTF Agent <agent@example.com>
Date: Fri, 18 Sep 2026 17:04:45 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] RCTF follow-up: notify assigned doctor on booking + collect
 doctor phone/qualification at user creation

- create_appointment now also emits an in-app notification to the
  appointment's assigned doctor (in addition to the existing
  receptionist broadcast), when that doctor has a linked login.
- CreateUserRequest/UpdateUserRequest gain optional phone/qualification
  fields, threaded through to ensure_doctor_profile, so creating (or
  promoting) a doctor-role user from the Users module no longer leaves
  the auto-created practitioner-directory row with placeholder values.
- Users.tsx: phone/qualification fields shown conditionally when the
  doctor role is selected.

NOTE: unexecuted in this environment -- run cargo check + TS build
before merging, same as the prior commit.
